      "mergeID": "63e160282c714512c72881fc",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Description of the bug: When opening my quick menu social wing or the social tab in the big menu it'll show friends online, but this is old data from last time I opened my menu. The only way to update what I'm presented with, I have to scroll past it, then back to it for it to update the data.\n\nSteps to reproduce\n\n- Open social tab in big menu to load Friend Location as an example.\n\n- Close the menu and play for a bit\n\n- After some time, friends will have changed their location etc.\n\n- Open the menu again, the friend locations shown on screen is the same data from before. \n\n- Since the social tab uses a \"lazy loading\" technique, I can correct the bug by scrolling down and back up to where I was. Friend locations are now updated.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1277] Social tab \"lazy load\" confusing when opening wing/big menu social tab",
